      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEED NOT TO WARRY (8) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished fifth at Albion Park over 1660m when well supported. LITTLE SURFER GIRL (2) put the writing on the wall when fourth in stronger company last time. Should get every chance from this draw. PENNIE PACKER (4) was in the money at this track two runs ago before having her colours lowered at her latest appearance over 1780m at this track, beaten 8 metres after racing in behind the leader at the bell. Perfectly placed and is sure to be fighting out the finish. JUSTANOTHER TORQUE (7) finished third last start over 1660m at Albion Park when trying to lead all of the way, that effort coming on the back of a fourth at this track the run before. Drawn to enjoy an economical run. Go well.",
